# AI3DDesign — Cursor context

This repo is **Matrix Workshop**: Node `server.js` + `public/` Three.js viewport + `scripts/*-build.mjs` (jewelry CSG, Cuban chain, complex pendant).

## Always read first

- **`AGENTS.md`** — pipeline, flags (`printTight`, `referenceIced`, `vectorId`), exports, performance. Treat as source of truth for CAD behavior.

## Two deployables

1. **Workshop** — `node server.js`. Static files and paths resolve from **`__dirname`** (`ROOT`), not `cwd`. See `DEPLOY.md` / `Dockerfile`.
2. **`matrix-ai-hub/`** — separate **Next.js** app for Vercel (`npm run dev` → port **3010**). Own `package.json`. Not merged into `server.js`. Fine-tune: `npm run finetune` from `matrix-ai-hub/` (needs `OPENAI_API_KEY`).

## LLM / AI

- Server chat/vision uses **`lib/openai-compatible.js`**: `OPENAI_BASE_URL`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, optional `OPENAI_ALLOW_NO_KEY=1`.
- Hub chat injects **`matrix-ai-hub/lib/elite-system-prompt.ts`** server-side; optional `LLM_SYSTEM_APPEND` on Vercel.

## When editing

- Match existing style; minimal diffs unless the task requires more.
- Heavy mesh builds can take **many minutes** — don’t assume fast CSG without `printTight` or reduced `roundCount`.
